    "---\n",
    "## ⏳ Step 4 — Hazard Model + HMM State Tracking\n",
    "\n",
    "### Hazard Model\n",
    "Estimates **P(contact point fails at attempt t | survived up to t-1)** using a discrete-time survival model. This tells us how likely each additional dial is to reach a real person.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Hidden Markov Model\n",
    "A phone number transitions between hidden states (valid → avoiding → switched_off → invalid). The HMM infers the **filtered posterior α_t** = P(state_t | observations_1:t), which feeds the decision layer."
   ]
