    "---\n",
    "## 🚨 Step 5 — Recycled-Number Detector & Suppression List\n",
    "\n",
    "**Compliance-first:** A missed recycled number = debt disclosed to a stranger.\n",
    "Target: **≥ 99% recall** (suppressing legitimate numbers is a smaller cost than the compliance breach).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Detection Methods\n",
    "1. **CUSUM change detection** on per-phone RPC rate (stat shift → recycled)\n",
    "2. **NLP keyword matching** on Hindi/Hinglish disposition remarks\n",
    "3. **Verified contact points** (ground truth override)"
   ]
